  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPrime Location & Top School Zones:\r\n• Zoned for Long Bay College, Northcross Intermediate, Torbay & Glamorgan Schools\r\n• Minutes to: Waiake & Long Bay Beaches, Torbay Village, Albany Westfield & Park & Ride\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n• Build & Section: Solid Brick & Cedar Weatherboard | Freehold Section\r\n• Main House: 3 Bedrooms + Study | 2 Modern Bathrooms\r\n• Separate Studio: Self-contained 1 Bed + 1 Bath (Ideal for granny, teens, or home office\r\n• Situated on a 681 m² site within the Mixed Housing Suburban Zone, this property presents excellent long-term development and subdivision potential.\r\n\r\nModern Living & Outdoor Flow:\r\n• Modern kitchen with premium benchtops & quality appliances\r\n• Sun-filled sunroom with peaceful bush views\r\n• Main bedrooms & study flow directly onto an expansive entertaining deck\r\n\r\nExtremely versatile family sanctuary in a private, quiet pocket. Don't miss out!",
